Rename the corresponding i18n identity and ultimate-description keys to lolanthe and lolantheUlt.

Replace the static selector button with carLolanthe, update data-car, data-i18n, labels, main.js click wiring, menu tests, garage references, documentation, and any other vehicle-specific UI reference.

There should be no stale user-visible Bolt vehicle after this implementation.

Do not blindly rename unrelated uses of the English word “bolt” if they refer to some unrelated mechanic or historical comment. Audit each occurrence based on meaning.

