Lolanthe and Verdant do not become offensive Flann-style rams merely because they can clear hazards.

7. Create the new Mind Controlled Condition

Add a real new debuff Condition for Lolanthe’s power.

Use an internal ID such as mindControlled or another consistent project-style identifier, with localized display text “Mind Controlled”.

